   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.26.1#p1-0f27d793",
     "text": "Which came because of their whoredom and idolatry.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "plague"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.26.3",
   "range": "NUM.26.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9f5c9aed",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.26.3#p1-9f5c9aed",
     "text": "Where the river is near to Jericho.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "near Jericho"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.26.9",
   "range": "NUM.26.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cd7c97ec",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.26.9#p1-cd7c97ec",
     "text": "In that rebellion of which Korah was head.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "company of Korah"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.26.10",
   "range": "NUM.26.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f0b0313e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.26.10#p1-f0b0313e",
     "text": "That is, as an example that others should not complain and rebel against God's ministers.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "became a sign"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.26.19",
   "range": "NUM.26.19",
